8859:# groups come from Get-EndpointGroups over the runners. A group runs 1 member at a time unless
8860:# the roster's top-level "parallel" raises its label (a merged group: the smallest limit of its
8861:# labels); -Cap (-PanelConcurrency) caps the total (0 = no cap, 1 = strictly one after another
8862:# in roster order). $Runners: the members Select-PanelMembers runs (State 'run'), in roster
